sequenceDiagram
 participant GUI as GUI / Control
 participant HOST as Host Automation
 participant Q as Bounded Parameter Transport
 participant ENG as Equaform Engine
 participant DSP as DSP
 GUI->>Q: ParameterCommand
 HOST->>Q: Automation event + sample offset
 Q->>ENG: Consume bounded events
 ENG->>DSP: Apply parameter at required offset
 DSP-->>ENG: Process audio
